  "agent_final_text": "Created `probe.py`. It exits with status 1 (no `summary.json` written) if the given directory doesn't exist, otherwise scans direct `*.json` children for a top-level `cost_usd` key and writes `{total, mean, n}` to `summary.json` \u2014 `mean` is `null` when `n` is 0 to avoid a bogus zero-population mean.",
